  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？\r\n果穂、どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\nこれ、見てください！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これって……\r\n……ああ、温湿度計か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今の湿度、60パーセント、なんです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、そうみたいだけど……\r\nそれがどうかしたのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "学校の先生が、『湿度は空気の中に水がどれくらいあるか』\r\nだって言ってました",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "このまま湿度が上がって100パーセントになったら……\r\n事務所が水の中になるってことですよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええ……！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなったら、\r\n事務所でお魚も泳げちゃいます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いろんなお魚を飼って水族館みたいにしたり……\r\n色んなことができそうです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "スッゴく楽しそうですっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（面白い発想だけど……\r\n果穂はちょっと勘違いをしているようだ）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "そんなに\r\n水があったら……",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂は\r\nいいところに気付くな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "泳げるように\r\nなるかもしれないな！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "事務所が水浸しになって、\r\nパソコンや書類も使えなくなっちゃうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えぇ！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そ、それは大変ですっ！\r\nみんなお仕事ができなくなっちゃいます！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なんとかしないと……！\r\nえっと、シートをかけたりしたら大丈夫でしょうか！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "後は、えっと、えーっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "か、果穂、すまん！\r\n今のは冗談だっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっ？\r\nそ、そうなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、湿度がどれだけ高くなっても\r\n実際に水の中になったりしないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゃあ、水びたしにならないってことですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういうことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "よ、よかった～……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "怖がらせて悪かったな",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、ちょっとびっくりしちゃっただけです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも……！　\r\nもし本当に事務所が大ピンチになったら……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしが、ヒーローみたいに救ってみせます！",
    "charAnim1": "hero",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010180"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010190,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……？\r\nどういうことですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "事務所の中が水中になったら……なんて、\r\n俺にはなかなか浮かばないからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "柔軟な発想で、すごいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゅーなんな、はっそう……！\r\nえへへ、ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nただ、湿度についてちょっと勘違いをしてるみたいだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006010210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900601/2009006010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、湿度っていうのは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
